                  },
                  {
                    "children": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Investment is held constant across scenarios; only value realization scales (±30%). Value-to-Cost is the whole-contract ratio — it includes the one-time implementation fee and the early adoption ramp. Payback is measured from day one, so a 30% downside shifts it out further than an equal upside pulls it in.",
