                        "tag": "TEXT",
                      },
                      {
                        "children": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "At 70% realization — 30% lower across every domain — this model returns $9.0M net (payback at month 12). The floor is positive and well-defined. The base case at $16.3M reflects conservative utilization targets and phased onset timing. Everything above that is execution: faster adoption, earlier go-live, capacity that converts to scheduled volume. The range is tight. All of it works.",
                          },
                        ],
                        "kind": "primitive",
                        "props": {
                          "style": {
